{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "85f8baa3-fa42-8f04-afdd-87c1ce433f7d",
  "created_at": "2026-02-23T15:36:37-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Brendan Dolan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T15:34:16-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T15:34:20-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Denise. I'm calling about a streetlight. I have three things for you, really. First, where it is. Second, what it's doing. Third, what I'd like done."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T15:34:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, go ahead, I'm ready."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T15:34:33-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "First, the location is 401 Narragansett Avenue, in the Fifth Ward. The pole is right out front, at the edge of the property."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T15:34:42-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401 Narragansett. And what's the light doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T15:34:46-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Second, it's pointing the wrong way. Since the nor'easter, the one last weekend, Saturday into Sunday, the lamp head looks like it got knocked or twisted. Now the light shines straight into our bedroom window. It's bright enough that the whole room is lit up at night."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T15:35:02-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's no good. So it's still working, it's just aimed at your house now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T15:35:08-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct. It's on and it works. It's just aimed wrong. Hold on one second, I'm stopping for coffee. [pause] Sorry, the barista is calling out names and I want to make sure it isn't mine. Okay, not mine. Go on."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T15:35:22-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Do you know if there's a number on the pole? Sometimes there's a little tag, kind of at eye level."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T15:35:30-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I haven't checked that. I can look when I get home. But it's the only pole on that side of the block near the house, so a crew should be able to find it from the address."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T15:35:43-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That should be fine. I'll put it in with the address and the description, light has shifted and is shining into a bedroom."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T15:35:51-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. And third, what I'm asking for is a crew to come check the pole. I'd like somebody to look at the fixture, and the pole itself, in case the storm loosened something. I'm not asking for a rush, just an inspection."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T15:36:06-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Crews have a backlog after a storm like that, so I can't give you a day, but this will go on the list. Can I get a callback number in case they have questions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T15:36:18-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0184."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T15:36:20-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0184. And it's Brendan?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T15:36:22-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, Brendan Dolan. D-O-L-A-N."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T15:36:24-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect, Mr. Dolan. You're all set. If the tag number turns up, call back and we'll add it to the request."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T15:36:32-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Thanks, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T15:36:34-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
